# Copy to .env in this directory and fill in. weather.sh reads it; without a key
# every reading is 0.0 and the bar shows 0.0°C, which is exactly what a missing
# .env looks like — there is no error anywhere.
#
#   OPENWEATHER_KEY      free key: https://home.openweathermap.org/api_keys
#                        (a new key takes a couple of hours to start working)
#   OPENWEATHER_CITY_ID  https://openweathermap.org/find — search the city and
#                        take the number at the end of the result URL.
#                        Istanbul is 745044, Ankara 323786, Izmir 311046.
#   OPENWEATHER_UNIT     metric | imperial | standard
#
# .env is gitignored, so the key never leaves this machine.

OPENWEATHER_KEY=
OPENWEATHER_CITY_ID=745044
OPENWEATHER_UNIT=metric
